---
/* index.html — section 1 of 7, carried across verbatim, with one change.

   DEVIATION: the video is preload="metadata", not the original's
   preload="auto". hillrun-4k.mp4 is 7.1MB and auto told the browser to
   pull all of it before anything else finished — on a home page already
   carrying 13MB across 38 requests, that is most of why the site felt
   slow. metadata fetches the header, then the player streams the rest
   once it decides to play, which it still does automatically.

   Nothing about the design changes. The poster covers the first moment
   either way, and phones were never affected: the <source> media query
   means they only ever load the 1.1MB crop. */
---

<section class="hero hero-run" aria-label="Season 02">
  <div class="hero-media hm-run"><video autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback x-webkit-airplay="deny" preload="metadata" poster="/assets/img/j-hillrun.jpg" data-parallax="0.1" aria-label="Friends running down a hillside into the sunset"><source src="/assets/video/hillrun-m.mp4" type="video/mp4" media="(max-width: 767px)"><source src="/assets/video/hillrun-4k.mp4" type="video/mp4" media="(min-width: 768px)"></video><script is:inline>(function(v){try{if(matchMedia('(max-width: 767px)').matches)v.setAttribute('poster','/assets/img/j-hillrun-m.jpg')}catch(e){}})(document.currentScript.previousElementSibling)</script></div>
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <span class="label hero-label">Season 02 · now boarding</span>
    <h1 class="h1 hero-h"><span class="hh">We bring</span> <span class="rot2" data-words="culture,chaos,people,noise,stories"><span class="rot2-w">culture</span></span></h1>
    <span class="serif hero-tail">you will tell later</span>
    <div class="row row-center hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-acid btn-buy" href="apply.html" data-cursor="Go">Get your spot<span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="pill pill-ghost-light" href="#now" data-cursor="See">See the trips</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-strip">
    <div class="hero-strip-head"><span>Upcoming</span><span>Two departures, one season</span></div>
    <div class="hero-cards">
      <a class="hero-card" href="hallucia.html" data-cursor="See"><div class="m"><img src="/assets/img/card-moodindigo.jpg" alt="Hallucia trip" fetchpriority="high"></div><b>Hallucia’26</b><small>25 Nov · from ₹8,999</small></a>
      <a class="hero-card" href="mood-indigo.html" data-cursor="See"><div class="m"><img src="/assets/img/card-mi26b.jpg" alt="Mood Indigo trip" fetchpriority="high"></div><b>Mood Indigo’26</b><small>December · from ₹8,499</small></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
